# Bazel's convenience symlinks from building the e2e/smoke module in its own
# directory. bazel-smoke/external/rules_tofu+ points back at this repo (the
# module's local_path_override), so a later `//...` from the root would loop
# through it. Listed one by one: a pattern in REPO.bazel's ignore_directories
# still logs "infinite symlink expansion detected" while scanning them.
e2e/smoke/bazel-bin
e2e/smoke/bazel-out
e2e/smoke/bazel-smoke
e2e/smoke/bazel-testlogs
